# 🔭 The Intelligence Loop

Atlas continuously cycles through a planetary feedback loop:

```text
OBSERVE
   ↓
UNDERSTAND
   ↓
SIMULATE
   ↓
DECIDE
   ↓
COORDINATE
   ↓
BUILD
   ↓
MEASURE
   ↓
LEARN
   ↓
IMPROVE
   ↺
```

The system becomes more valuable as the loop becomes more accurate, more transparent, more distributed, and more useful to the people operating it.

