# 📜 Governance

Atlas is intended to evolve as an open ecosystem.

Governance should address:

* technical stewardship
* protocol evolution
* AI safety
* responsible deployment
* community participation
* data governance
* model governance
* security disclosures
* ecosystem standards
* conflict resolution
* public-interest safeguards

See [`GOVERNANCE.md`](./GOVERNANCE.md).

